WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:45.000
On Ball 1, start with green flag, show, forever, and glide.

00:45.000 --> 01:40.000
Set glide to 180 divided by tempo. Use x -190 and y -180.

01:40.000 --> 02:30.000
Add an if block. Check whether y position is less than -179.

02:30.000 --> 04:00.000
Inside if, add hide, wait, and show. Build the random wait divided by tempo.

04:00.000 --> 05:30.000
Add go to x -190 and y 143 at the bottom of the if block.

05:30.000 --> 06:30.000
Check every number and connect the complete falling stack.

06:30.000 --> 06:45.000
Click the green flag. Ball 1 should fall, hide, wait, and return to the top.
